# INVWINOC.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the location
# tree's notes on the status bar.  A location added shows its note
# there, naming it, until the next key; one saved, its note; one whose
# form is cancelled, none; a delete refused, none; one deleted, its
# note; New location from the menu, its note too; the end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINOC.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-L B INS
T Crate C3
K ENTER
S ADDED
K HOME
S CLEARED
K DOWN CTRL-E
T Crate C4
K ENTER
S SAVED
K CTRL-E
T x
K ESC Y
S CANCEL
K HOME DEL Y
S HELD
K ENTER
S HELDOK
K DOWN DEL Y
S DELETED
K ALT-L N
T Garage
K ENTER
S MENUNEW
K ALT-F X
